# Nexus Industries Code of Ethics and Business Conduct

**Document Type:** Corporate Policy
**Authority Level:** 1 (Authoritative)
**Policy Number:** POL-001
**Effective Date:** January 1, 2024
**Last Reviewed:** January 2026
**Owner:** General Counsel
**Classification:** Public

---

## Purpose

This Code of Ethics and Business Conduct establishes the standards of ethical behavior expected of all Nexus Industries employees, officers, directors, and contractors. It reflects our commitment to integrity, transparency, and responsible business practices.

---

## Scope

This policy applies to:
- All Nexus Industries employees worldwide
- Officers and Directors
- Temporary workers and interns
- Contractors and consultants acting on behalf of Nexus
- Joint venture partners (where applicable)

