## Reporting Violations

### Channels

| Channel | Contact | When to Use |
|---------|---------|-------------|
| Manager | Direct | Initial concerns |
| HR | hr@nexus-industries.com | Employment issues |
| Ethics Hotline | 1-800-555-ETHX | Anonymous reporting |
